Comment: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ep}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.05,0:00:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the important bottle that\NIoryogi gave me for passing the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When this bottle is filled, my wish will come true and I'll finally be able to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.51,0:00:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When do you think that will be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm looking forward to it, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.77,0:00:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one who's going to fill it up, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato Hanato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.73,0:02:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.87,0:02:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just getting that bottle is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you collecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The wounded hearts of people, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.95,0:02:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And when you gather those?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.45,0:02:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to heal those wounded hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right! At least you seem to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's go get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I forgot to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.11,0:02:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't speak to me in the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.73,0:02:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.71,0:02:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since you lack all memories, knowledge and common sense, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stuffed animals can't speak here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.91,0:02:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so talking to something that can't talk back would be weird, got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.55,0:02:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't they speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because they're stuffed animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't stuffed animals speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right! I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't suddenly jump off the see-saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anyone here with a wounded heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anyone here who wants to be healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.63,0:03:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anyone here with a wounded heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:25.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please let me heal your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.19,0:03:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.34,0:03:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me! Is there anything I can do to heal you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there any way I can be of service?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:39.13,Default Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey miss, could you help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.22,0:03:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When we play kick the can, you can be "it"!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? Would it be helpful if I were "it"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.89,0:03:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kick the can!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, that's strange. There's nothing in the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How does being "it" heal anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.31,0:04:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody's heart would be healed by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.99,0:04:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All you did was play a game with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.75,0:04:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.18,0:04:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's pretty hard to meet someone who wants their heart to be healed, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if there's no one that wants to be healed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,then there's no sad person with a\Nwounded heart! That's a good thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.18,0:05:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez, you put a positive spin on everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.89,0:05:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could find someone who needs help...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're giving this... to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.59,0:05:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To think that you go around to people and hand out wonderful things like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a wonderful person you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've still got a lot to get rid of...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.17,0:05:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be a big help if you'd\Ntake as many as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.09,0:05:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll take them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.48,0:05:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks! You saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not only did I help him, but I\Ngot all of this great stuff too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.35,0:05:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you gonna do with all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.01,0:06:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now it's my turn to give these\Nwonderful things to other people!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.77,0:06:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go! Wonderful tissues!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.81,0:06:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure they'll be useful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.52,0:06:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have some!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give you lots!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.97,0:06:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wonderful tissues right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.39,0:06:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.78,0:06:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit fooling around in the middle of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.52,0:06:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That one guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And pick up all those tissues.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.47,0:06:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:07:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please let me thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think he went this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The sheets went flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.18,0:07:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She bruised her nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She did!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.02,0:07:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so embarrassed...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.71,0:07:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,you shouldn't be laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.12,0:07:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I work here at Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're so understaffed that I even have to do the laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.64,0:07:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're understaffed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And it gives you problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:07:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would it help to have more workers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would it help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.49,0:08:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.87,0:08:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, take these!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Toshihiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Kobato Hanato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a weird name!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Weird name!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.59,0:08:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So your dad's name must be Obato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.13,0:09:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.59,0:09:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have a dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.49,0:09:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't care about his name!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go play!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, don't crowd around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What would you like me to help out with?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be great if you just kept them busy like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kept them busy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.94,0:09:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Play the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.90,0:09:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I don't know how to play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.37,0:09:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.43,0:09:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But we can all dance together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.79,0:09:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Mr. Kiyokazu, come play the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to dance together with Miss Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's not a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then... Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.45,0:10:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.13,0:10:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.29,0:10:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm helping out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't play the organ.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, are you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Kiyokazu Fujimoto.\NYou'll be working with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.23,0:10:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And this is Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.74,0:10:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please try and get along today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.93,0:10:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:11:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Kiyokazu, come and play the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up, teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.59,0:11:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, then I'll leave it up to you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.10,0:11:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.42,0:11:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's such a bully!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato is funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.57,0:12:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this where all the children live?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.37,0:12:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They don't live here, we just watch them during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, is that so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.21,0:12:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But this place is kind of old.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.99,0:12:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Newer nurseries have opened close by,\Nso fewer and fewer children come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.83,0:12:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,However!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We have to do our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no point in worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.78,0:12:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You really helped us out, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The children looked like they were really having fun too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.83,0:12:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all, I was just playing with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.93,0:13:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That kind of thing always makes Ioryogi mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.93,0:13:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no! Ioryogi's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Was there someone with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Well, I had a stuffed animal with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since he can't talk, I'll have to go get him or else I'll be in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I come back tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know where she lives or what she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.71,0:13:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do we really want her around the children?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.49,0:13:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You do know! I'm Kobato Hanato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think just knowing your name is enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm trying to find that out myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you can, you're more than welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.95,0:14:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, we won't really be able to pay you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.00,0:14:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! Just being able to help out is a good enough payment for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then we look forward to having you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.05,0:14:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.26,0:14:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.52,0:14:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're just doing this out of pity or curiosity, don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll just inconvenience us if you\Nthink that we're pitiful or overworked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.95,0:14:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.65,0:14:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cause trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Causing trouble, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you leave me\Nbehind in the middle of town!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.19,0:15:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad you found me, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.27,0:15:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have any idea what would\Nhave happened if someone took me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.24,0:15:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.78,0:15:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you? I'm a stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.37,0:15:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stuffed animals don't just walk around on their own!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.41,0:15:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you forget the bottle too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.12,0:15:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.05,0:15:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, "of course"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did ya think there'd be anything in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.32,0:15:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, there was nothing I could do to heal anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.47,0:15:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I just caused trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto seemed like he was wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he said that I just cause trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.37,0:16:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it all depends on the person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know there are both wounded and unwounded people in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.58,0:16:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I didn't know that there are wounded people who don't want to be healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.35,0:16:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.80,0:16:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.68,0:16:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.76,0:16:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You wanna heal them, right? So heal them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.67,0:16:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that the right thing to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Worry about whether it's the right thing to do or not after you actually heal them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.63,0:16:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.33,0:17:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.38,0:17:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.70,0:17:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.10,0:17:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nursery is over? Are you going home now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.27,0:17:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like swings?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but I don't really like them that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.69,0:17:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I have to wait here a bit more because Mom's not home yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's at work, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.85,0:17:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She works really hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:18:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And even though it's been hard since the divorce, she still makes me breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.43,0:18:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And she's really nice! Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.38,0:18:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you gonna say that it's horrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.28,0:18:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko, is your mother late again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.90,0:18:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. It's good of you to not be selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.47,0:18:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Again today, Toshihiko? You're such a good boy for waiting for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.49,0:18:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be nice if your mom thought of you a little more, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:19:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if she's busy at work, isn't this a bit too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.88,0:19:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone says she's a bad mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.82,0:19:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That she's a poor mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.78,0:19:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A poor mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.87,0:19:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're wrong! She works her hardest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really! She's a great mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.23,0:19:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.65,0:19:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's wonderful that you have such a great and hardworking mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.68,0:19:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.40,0:19:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! She's a great mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does something hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's something in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.49,0:20:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.67,0:20:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's from that Toshihiko kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.07,0:20:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.83,0:20:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:20:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Swing, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko, you're really good at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.01,0:21:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, keep trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.88,0:21:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was really happy that you praised his mom and were kind to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was... kind to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.86,0:21:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If your heart's not in the right place,\Nkindness won't be enough to heal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just keep doing what you did there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.37,0:21:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.84,0:21:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll work hard and keep trying to collect people's wounded hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.47,0:21:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.32,0:21:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That makes it sound like you're gonna go around wounding them yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.65,0:21:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then... their healed hearts?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That makes it sound like you're gonna take them away right after you heal them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.92,0:22:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then... what should I call these?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.32,0:22:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez, you're annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.64,0:22:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They look like konpeito, so just call 'em that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.77,0:22:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Konpeito...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.43,0:22:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right! I'll call them konpeito!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.27,0:22:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.81,0:22:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.32,0:22:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Abandoning me was really bad, but the rest was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.69,0:22:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You get 100 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.69,0:22:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep up the good work, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.66,0:22:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.91,0:22:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.36,0:22:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't slack off because you got 100!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.08,0:22:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you said to keep up the good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.63,0:22:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.22,0:22:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:22:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine! No 100 after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:22:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No fair!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.77,0:02:10.02,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,1000)\pos(360,65)}...The Konpeito's Shine.
